    "detailed_description": "The usual crew goes on a school trip adventure!<br><br>Enjoy &quot;Pillow Fight,&quot; &quot;Rickshaw Race,&quot;<br>&quot;Souvenir Battle,&quot;and more for a total of<br>10 different missions!<br><br>Try gathering the Collection Coins for yourself<br>or challenge all missions in order to become a<br>true &quot;Field Trip Master!&quot;<br><br>[Pillow Fight]<br>Throw your pillow and fight to win!<br><br>[Karaoke Battle]<br>Become the karaoke number one!<br><br>[Rickshaw Race]<br>Carry your passengers to the goal!<br><br>[Sightseeing Snapshots]<br>Go sightseeing and take the best snapshots!<br><br>[Hide from the Teacher]<br>Play and avoid getting caught!<br><br>[Pottery Experience]<br>Make pottery to match the picture!<br><br>[Speed Showdown]<br>Make quick decisions and win!<br><br>[Gather the Deer!]<br>Gather deer in your enclosure!<br><br>[Souvenir Battle]<br>Help at the store and deliver souvenirs!<br><br>[Grand Spy Operation]<br>Sneak your way to the top floor!",
